Chameleon: Ah, Doctor! Long time no see! How are the research grants coming?

Malatesta: Research? Huh? Oh? Who said anything about research?

Chameleon: Oh, come now, Doctor, it's what you're known for. You're always
working on one project or another, aren't you?

Malatesta: Ah, right, right. Research. It's all going entirely according to
plan. Exactly as predicted on the IRB proposal documents. Always wonderful,
when everything happens just the way it's supposed to.

